Admitted that in the event of a restitution East Jerusalem would also be included.
"Whether he wants security in Jerusalem and therefore doesn't want the tractors or excavators to pass above their legs as happened to one of my best friends, then he will have to deliver a part of Jerusalem," Olmert said, referring to the two July attacks in the city in which there were several deaths and dozens of people were injured.
