His enormous resemblance to his sister hasn't stopped him from developing his own personality.
Monica Cruz is small but full of vitality.
The Cruz Sisters now take their new fashion activity very seriously.
For Monica, they're much more than a handsome, celebrity girls who lend their name.
It has been in Paris in the promotion that Mango makes at its new headquarters, in addition to the presentation of the most important Fashion awards that the Spanish house sponsors.
Warm and shy, he wins in short distances.
Tell us what you're doing in Paris.
I have come to present the new collection devised by my sister Penelope and I for Mango in this new autumn-winter season, in addition to attending the presentation of the second edition of the 'Mango Fashion Awards' and the Opera din dinner in honor of Valentino.
